OL,3,CNicola Sturgeon feels like 'a mug'
OL,4,Cover husband and won't see him in
OL,5,Cprison
OL,7,FNicola Sturgeon has said she will not
OL,8,Fvisit her estranged husband in prison
OL,9,Fas she claimed she felt like a "mug"
OL,10,Ffor continuing to care about him.
OL,12,FPeter Murrell was jailed for more than
OL,13,Ffive years in June after pleading
OL,14,Fguilty to embezzling more than
OL,15,F#400,000 from the SNP while serving as
OL,16,Fits chief executive, spending the cash
OL,17,Fon luxury items.
OL,26,@qD@`OUqD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
