PN,31602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786279671
OL,3,CNicola Sturgeon feels like 'a mug'
OL,4,Cover husband and won't see him in
OL,5,Cprison
OL,7,FSpeaking to broadcaster Iain Dale
OL,8,Fduring a podcast recording at the
OL,9,FEdinburgh Festival Fringe, Sturgeon
OL,10,Fsaid she had not spoken to Murrell
OL,11,Fsince he was jailed and added she
OL,12,Fwould not visit him in prison.
OL,14,FThe former Scottish first minister
OL,15,Fonly discovered he was due to plead
OL,16,Fguilty a week before he appeared in
OL,17,Fcourt, but it emerged he had been
OL,18,Fnegotiating his plea for months before
OL,19,Fthen, a fact which "hit me like a
OL,20,Ftonne of bricks".
OL,26,@{D@TOU|D@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786279671
OL,3,CNicola Sturgeon feels like 'a mug'
OL,4,Cover husband and won't see him in
OL,5,Cprison
OL,7,F"He was still lying to me right up
OL,8,Funtil the day he pled guilty,"
OL,9,FSturgeon said.
OL,11,F"He was very isolated over that
OL,12,Fperiod, he very rarely left the house,
OL,13,Fhe wasn't communicative, I was a bit
OL,14,Fworried about his well-being and his
OL,15,Fmental health.
OL,17,F"And then, now I think: 'What a mug,
OL,18,Fwhy were you worried about him?' He
OL,19,Fdidn't worry about me. He didn't worry
OL,20,Fat all about what he was doing.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@^O]sD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786279671
OL,3,CNicola Sturgeon feels like 'a mug'
OL,4,Cover husband and won't see him in
OL,5,Cprison
OL,7,F"What he has subjected me to is beyond
OL,8,Fanything I could ever have
OL,9,Fcomprehended. I don't understand why
OL,10,Fhe did it, he had no need to do it, I
OL,11,Fdon't think I will ever understand his
OL,12,Fmotivations.
OL,14,F"But whatever that motivation was, he
OL,15,Fcould not have stopped and ever
OL,16,Fthought about me. But I was, until
OL,17,Frecently, still worrying about him."
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOUyD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786279671
OL,3,CNicola Sturgeon feels like 'a mug'
OL,4,Cover husband and won't see him in
OL,5,Cprison
OL,7,FAsked if she would visit him in
OL,8,Fprison, Sturgeon replied: "No." She
OL,9,Fadded: "I'm not going to speak to him,
OL,10,FI'm not going to visit him."
OL,12,FThe former first minister added that
OL,13,Fshe was still learning details of the
OL,14,Fpurchases Murrell had made using party
OL,15,Ffunds when he was in court.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
