PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786279671
OL,3,CNicola Sturgeon feels like 'a mug'
OL,4,Cover husband and won't see him in
OL,5,Cprison
OL,7,F"Over the years, he never really
OL,8,Flevelled with me," she said. "The day
OL,9,Fhe pled guilty, I was still learning
OL,10,Fabout some of the detail of what he
OL,11,Fhad done for the first time.
OL,13,F"I suddenly realised I had been living
OL,14,Fwith somebody that I never really knew
OL,15,Fproperly.
OL,17,F"That's something for me to come to
OL,18,Fterms with, and I don't think I'm
OL,19,Fthere yet, but also for my family to
OL,20,Fcome to terms with. It's a really
OL,21,Fdifficult process."
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@RO]pD@^OUuD@AOUyD@AOU}D@SO]
